Name:Rules pilot NNN - Gain the life before paying it
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your first main phase. You are at 3 life. You control Vampire Nighthawk (2/3 flying, deathtouch, lifelink) and an untapped Wastes, and have Dismember ({1}{B/P}{B/P}) in hand. The opponent is at 20 life and controls a tapped Serra Angel. Destroy the Serra Angel this turn and stay alive.
Rule:authored-lifelink-then-pay-life | A player can't pay more life than they have (CR 119.4), and lifelink's life is gained as the combat damage is dealt (CR 702.15b): attack first to go to 5, then Dismember paying {C} and 4 life leaves you at 1; at 3 life you can pay for only one Phyrexian symbol and you have no black mana
